":{"text":"陰険で残忍なカタストロフが進撃してきた時、吾は子らを率い、奴と共に迎え撃った！","source_cn":"阴险而残忍的恶魔入侵之时，吾引领子嗣，与他共同驱逐外敌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3D28ABF702E8192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410856016:0":{"text":"じゃが奴はそれだけでは満足せず、吾の鱗を剥いで鎧を作り、角を削いで刃を鍛えた！","source_cn":"可他并不满足！他剥下吾的鳞片炼成铠甲，削下吾的尖角磨成锐刺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375C15D2D4A953E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410856017:0":{"text":"奴は平和を口実に、吾を欺いたのじゃ。愚かにも、吾はその魂胆に気づかなんだ……！","source_cn":"他以和平作为大义，蒙骗吾为之付出，愚蠢的吾那时候并未醒悟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9B632EDB183066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410856018:0":{"text":"奴は戦死した吾が子の皮を剥ぎ、筋と骨を抜き取った。まだ生まれぬ命まで、砕き、喰らった！","source_cn":"直到吾战死的子嗣被他剥下皮囊，抽拔筋骨！吾尚未降世的子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA031882B4E8724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410856019:0":{"text":"それは……本当なのか？ヘクト様が、アンタにそんなことを……？","source_cn":"这是……真的吗……？赫托伤害过你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7604E2D4AE08BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410856020:0":{"text":"さよう！奴は吾をただの道具と